          "text": "{\"answer_text\":\"I can\u2019t determine what indication and development stage the graph records for gosuranemab because no graph data was supplied. From general knowledge, gosuranemab was studied in phase 2 trials for progressive supranuclear palsy and Alzheimer\u2019s disease, but that does not establish the graph\u2019s entry. This is an unverified development control, not clinical advice.\",\"claims\":[],\"unanswered\":[\"Which indication and development stage are recorded in the graph for gosuranemab?\"]}"
